{"type":"message","id":"0168e657","parentId":"3a83c014","timestamp":"2026-04-16T23:04:10.147Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_pxnve2l3shzmbhhy7h8jte9v","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Modal.com reviews 2024 platform reliability developer feedback\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 988,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0685c680a1b79cd6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nModal Reviews | Read Customer Service Reviews of modal.com\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0685c680a1b79cd6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/modal.com\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8218810a7af931a0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRead more To protect platform integrity, every review on our platform—verified or not—is screened by our 24/7 automated software. This technology is designed to identify and remove content that breaches our guidelines, including reviews that are not based on a genuine experience.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8218810a7af931a0\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.trustpilot.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"61119c897ef4355a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nModal Review: Serverless GPUs Without the Headache? - DeClom\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"61119c897ef4355a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://declom.com/modal\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"602e28463fad4194\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIs Modal the future of AI infrastructure? A deep-dive into its serverless platform , GPU scaling, pricing, and whether it can really end your DevOps nightmares.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"60