ng infrastructure.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9fd81f8a7b7d4e4e\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"aipure.ai\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"Modal.com reviews 2024 platform reliability developer feedback","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":988,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0685c680a1b79cd6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nModal Reviews | Read Customer Service Reviews of modal.com\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0685c680a1b79cd6\">>>","url":"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/modal.com","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8218810a7af931a0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRead more To protect platform integrity, every review on our platform—verified or not—is screened by our 24/7 automated software. This technology is designed to identify and remove content that breaches our guidelines, including reviews that are not based on a genuine experience.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8218810a7af931a0\">>>","siteName":"www.trustpilot.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"61119c897ef4355a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nModal Review: Serverless GPUs Without the Headache? - DeClom\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"61119c897ef4355a\">>>","url":"https://declom.com/modal","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"602e28463fad4194\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIs Modal the future of AI infrastructure? A deep-dive into its serverless platform , GPU scaling, pricing, and whether it can really end your DevOps nightmares.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"602e28463fad4194\">>>","siteName":"declom.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9348f0c54d527469\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nModal Reviews, Alternatives, and Pricing updated March 2026\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9348f0c54d527469\">>>","url":"https://opentools.ai/tools/modal","snippet":"\n<<<EXTE